# Docs screenshot: the GOAP tab (docs/editor/tab-goap.md, #45) - the
# lumberjack fixture's agent (copied in, as goap.drive does).
exec cp tests/goap/project/scenes/goap_lumberjack.scene.json $PROJECT/scenes/
exec cp tests/goap/project/scripts/goap_lumberjack.lua $PROJECT/scripts/
wait 90
click @menu:View
click @menu:View/Workspaces
click @menu:Workspaces/Animation
wait 5
dblclick @asset:scenes/goap_lumberjack.scene.json
wait 10
click @hier:Jack/GOAP
wait 3
click @bottom:goap
wait 3
expect goap-graph == GatherWood|PickUpAxe,ChopWood,PunchTree
click @gg.canvas
key f
wait 2
click @gg.action:ChopWood
wait 2
annotate @gg.goal:GatherWood A goal: its conditions (green dot: an action can meet it)
annotate @gg.action:ChopWood An action that meets it: cost, target, conditions, effects
annotate @gg.add-goal Add a goal or an action
annotate @gg.kind What the selected action does
annotate @gg.effect.add Its effects: what the planner links to conditions
annotate @gg.page:keys World and target keys, and the sensors that fill them
screenshot editor_tab-goap
key f1
expect noderef.page == editor/tab-goap
